  "description": "Who wants to reach the stars?\n\nEveryone is welcome to join and help build up a new shining guild on the horizon.\n\n........................\n\nRaid Times: \n- Mon-Fri, 13:37 CEST\n- Mon, Wed, Fri: higher raids (currently Celestial Observatory, Enchanted Oasis, or Floating Gardens of Aetheria)\n- (Tue), Thu: lower level raids for new members depending on the least active guild member&#039;s combat level (currently Crystal Caverns or Skyreach Peak)\n\nAssaults:\n- currently ~1x/week around raid or instead of raid (time not fixed yet and subject to change depending on your feedback!)\n\nEnergizing Pool Buff (subject to change)\n- Tue, 11:00 CEST (before assault)\n- Sat, 22:00 CEST \n- Sun, 22:00 CEST\n\n\n‐--------------------\n\nThis week&#039;s guild activities:\n\n- Mon (13:37 CEST): Raid at Floating Islands of Aetheria (requiring combat level 70)\n\n- Tue (13:37 - 17:37 CEST): Assault at Eldoria\n\n- Wed (13:37 CEST): Raid at Enchanted Oasis (requiring combat level 60)\n\n- Thu (13:37 CEST): Raid at Skyreach Peak (requiring combat level 40)\n\n- Fri (13:37 CEST): Raid at Celestial Observatory (requiring combat level 80)\n\n.......................................\n\nNext Guild Hall component:\n\nEmpty Slot:\n\n- 7,500 Mahogany Log (Stockpile: 3,382)\n- 10,000 Mystical Log (Stockpile: 89)\n- 10,000 Chromite Bar (Stockpile: 1,990)\n- 7,500 Mystic Bar (Stockpile: 457)\n\n.................\n\nGuild Hall Repairs:\n\nEach guild hall component decays over 80 days and needs to be repaired regularly.\n\nIn the following, you can find the repair costs of our active components as well as the last Date it was repaired. \nIt would be great, if we could always have a stock of materials available to repair the following components:\n\nEnergizing Pool (July, 16th):\n- 12,500 Spruce Log\n- 12,500 Maple Log\n- 7,500 Mystical Log\n- 7,500 Iron Bar\n- 7,500 Mercury Bar\n- 7,500 Uranium Bar\n\nTeleport Beacon (July, 17th):\n- 7,500 Yew Log\n- 7,500 Banyan Log\n- 10,000 Tin Bar\n- 7,500 Lead Bar\n- 5,000 Chromite Bar\n- 7,500 Mystic Bar",
